SUMMARY:Glorelys
LOCATION:Brooklyn Improv (The Lab)\, Williamsburg
DESCRIPTION:Glorelys Mora is a Dominican-American stand-up comedian\, actre
 
ss\, writer\, and Gemini born and raised in New York City. Known for her sh
 
arp wit\, fearless honesty\, and larger-than-life personality\, she brings 
 
a distinctly New York perspective to relationships\, family\, pop culture\,
 
 and the absurdities of everyday life. Glorelys has appeared on Netflix Is 
 
a Joke and Kevin Hart's Funny AF and was a finalist in the HBO Latino Stand
 
-Up Competition. She has performed at the Hollywood Improv\, The Comedy Sto
 
re\, The Stand\, and New York Comedy Club\, and has opened for Leslie Jones
 
\, Ralph Barbosa\, Zainab Johnson\, Erik Rivera\, and more. Additional cred
 
its include performing at the Edinburgh Festival Fringe\, writing for Audib
 
le's Michelle Rojas Is Not Okay\, and appearing in We're Not Married Yet\, 
 
streaming on Tubi. She is also the co-founder and co-host of the Morir Soñ
 
ando comedy podcast. She is also the co-founder and host of Morir Soñando 
 
Comedy\, a live comedy show and podcast celebrating Dominican and New York 
 
culture. DO NOT PURCHASE TICKETS FROM ANYONE OR ANY OTHER SITE OTHER THAN I
 
MPROV.COM TICKET RESALE IS STRICTLY PROHIBITED. TICKETS SUSPECTED OF BEING 
 
