hs. No cell phone use\, photography or video recording is permitted during 
 
performances. All sales are final. MISCELLANOUS: For group sales info\, e-m
 
ail our Events Manager to learn about special menu options and reserved sea
 
ting. Additional questions may be addressed in our Frequently Asked Questio
 
